    snippets={[
      { text: '<Suspense fallback={…}>', highlight: true },
      { text: '  <DataChild />' },
      { text: '</Suspense>', highlight: true },
    ]}
  />
</FixCardGrid>

> **Good to know:** Each fix card links to a detailed walkthrough with patterns, code samples, and trade-offs. Click a card to dive in.

